  "A woman designed this historic coin.",
  "The Alabama Centennial half dollar was minted in 1921.",
  "Laura Gardin Fraser became the first woman credited with designing a US coin.",
  "Alabama officials originally wanted a commemorative quarter instead.",
  "They changed the plan to a half dollar through new legislation.",
  "President Woodrow Wilson signed the act into law in May 1920."
